sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户
    participant NUC as NUC
    participant SPMS as SPMS
    participant OPS as OPS

    Client->>NUC: 填写寄件信息点击提交订单
    activate NUC
    NUC->>SPMS: SearchCustomerArrivalProductNew获取web_odatype
    activate SPMS
    SPMS-->>NUC: 返回product含web_odatype
    deactivate SPMS
    NUC->>OPS: VerifyRemoteAreaDetail校验偏远
    activate OPS
    alt 偏远地址
        OPS-->>NUC: Item等于true
        NUC-->>Client: 弹窗提示偏远确认后继续
    else 非偏远地址
        OPS-->>NUC: Item等于false
        NUC-->>Client: 正常提交订单
    end
    deactivate OPS
    deactivate NUC
